# 🚨 DIGIBIZ PRODUCTION SHIELD & ARCHITECTURAL RULES 🚨

1. NEVER directly modify any files inside `public/std/` or `public/snapshots/`.
2. All coding, feature development, and bug fixes MUST be performed in `public/modules/`, `public/core/`, `public/css/`, `public/scripts/`, `public/admin/`, `public/auth/`.
3. Test all changes on the Live Master URLs (`https://digibiz-sys.web.app/modules/...`).
4. To update paying PRO users on `std`, run:
   node scripts/sync-std.js
   firebase deploy --only hosting
5. PRO users run on `std` (`/std/`). Demo & Trial users run on Live Master (`/modules/...`).
